                            "last_played": 1781951368
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Enjoyed the story and happy to write a positive review. Nice writing, artwork, and simple sound effects. Just enough occasional character movement to visually break things up,  Music was also well done and flowed with the story.  There are no player choices, you just read the short story from screen to screen.  Took me about a few hours.  The game badges are outstanding.   Best wishes to the developer.",
